menu "eGauge configuration"

config EGAUGE_WIFI_BULK_ENABLED
    bool "Advertise experimental authenticated Wi-Fi bulk transfer"
    default n
    help
        Enables the owner-only temporary SoftAP negotiation commands and
        advertises experimental-softap-aead-v2. Keep disabled until the exact
        firmware and Android build complete a live encrypted transfer.

config EGAUGE_DISPLAY_CALIBRATION
    bool "Boot into the physical display calibration sequence"
    default n
    help
        Replaces the gauge runtime with touch-cycled panel test patterns for
        bench characterization. This mode does not start BLE or OBD tasks and
        must remain disabled in release firmware.

config EGAUGE_UI_PERFORMANCE_LOG
    bool "Log touch-to-render timing and LVGL stack headroom"
    default n
    help
        Bench-only timing summaries every 30 seconds after touches. Measures
        LVGL click dispatch through the next render submission, not physical
        contact or final panel scanout. Does not generate touches or car data.

config EGAUGE_ECM_ADAPTER_MAC
    string "ECM BLE adapter MAC address (blank discovers first compatible adapter)"
    default ""
    help
        Six octets separated by colons. The adapter must advertise service 18F0.
        Configure this for deterministic source binding.

config EGAUGE_TCM_ADAPTER_MAC
    string "TCM BLE adapter MAC address (blank disables second link)"
    default ""
    help
        Must differ from the ECM address. The second link connects only to this
        address and remains idle until TCM PID definitions are configured.

endmenu
